  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a014e981164b34ef4b183cb579b7e688, type: 3}
  m_Name: 03_OfficeLedger
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TheLightenRoad.Codex::TheLightenRoad.Codex.ArchiveLog
  Id: office-ledger
  Title: The Unfinished Ledger
  Location: CORPORATE OFFICE / RECEPTION
  Text: 'The last entry is unfinished. A ring of soot marks the place where the clerk
    kept a small lamp.


    Names were entered, drawers were sealed, and the office
    carried on as though the world outside had not already ended. Someone left a
    final note between the pages: leave enough light for the return journey.'
  RoomClue: A Flare spends one whole ember. Keep a reserve before exploring the darker
    end of the office.
  Audio: {fileID: 0}
